# Jason_PKM_Architecture .gitignore

# 1. 排除所有個人內容 (Exclude all personal content)
00_Raw/Inbox/*
00_Raw/Processed/*
00_Raw/Assets/*
01_Wiki/Summaries/*
01_Wiki/Concepts/*
02_Outputs/Projects/*
02_Outputs/Learning_Tasks/*
02_Outputs/Q&A/*
02_Outputs/Visuals/*
04_Archive/*

# 2. 排除個人導航地圖 (Exclude personal navigation map)
01_Wiki/Main_Index.md

# 3. 保留資料夾結構 (Keep directory structure via .gitkeep)
!**/ .gitkeep

# 4. 保留系統元數據與指令 (Keep system metadata and instructions)
!03_Meta/**
03_Meta/Health_Checks/*
!README.md
!01_Wiki/Main_Index_Template.md

# 5. 排除 Obsidian 系統設定 (Exclude Obsidian settings)
.obsidian/
.trash/
.DS_Store
